set_option linter.style.longLine false

/-! # Configured memory execution through Sail

SP1's machine-mode assumptions disable pointer masking, MPRV, HTIF and PMP entries. They leave
unrelated registers arbitrary. The generated model retains stock PMP and hypervisor support;
these proofs reduce supported aligned accesses through its PMA/PMP and translation checks.
-/

open LeanRV64D
namespace SP1Clean.SailMem

open LeanRV64D.Functions Sail Sail.ArchSem SailState SP1Clean.TryStepReduction

set_option linter.style.setOption false
-- Helper functions generated by sail that we generally don't want in practice
